	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r07r0301_woman_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あら　あなたの　ポケモン……▼
つかれている　みたいね
ひとやすみして　いきなさいな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T09:07:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あら　あなたの　ポケモン……▼
つかれている　みたいね
ひと休みして　いきなさいな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T09:07:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・HP/PP満タン時</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T07:49:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>お母さん
WOMAN3</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r07r0301_woman_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いっぽんばしを　あるくのって
おもったより　つかれるでしょ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>一本橋を　歩くのって
思ったより　つかれるでしょ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・HP/PP満タンでない時
　続けて画面暗転して回復処理</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T07:49:12" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>お母さん
WOMAN3</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r07r0301_boy_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おれ　みたんだ！▼
ぜんぜん　ちがう　すがた　だったけど
あれは　ぜったいに　ランドロスに▽
トルネロス　ボルトロス　だったっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T07:59:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おれ　みたんだ！▼
ぜんぜん　違う　姿だったけど
あれは　絶対に　ランドロスに▽
トルネロス　ボルトロス　だったっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T07:59:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T07:49:17" />
		</CommentCell>
